# Nitish Kumar — Portfolio

Frontend-only portfolio (Vite + React). Content lives in local data files — **no Django/API required**.

## Run

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:5173

## Update content

| What | File |
|------|------|
| Profile, skills, experience, education, certificates | `src/data/resume.ts` |
| Selected work cards | `src/data/projects.ts` |
| Resume PDF | `public/resume.pdf` |
| Profile photo | `public/profile.jpg` |
| Certificates | `public/certificates/` |

After editing data files, refresh the browser.

## Contact form

Opens the visitor’s email app (`mailto:`) with their message — no server needed.

## Scripts

- `npm run dev` — local development
- `npm run build` — production build
- `npm run preview` — preview production build
